===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[handle]] with [[kid gloves]]}}

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To treat something very [[delicately]] or [[carefully]].
#: ''The campaign staff cautioned the candidate to '''handle''' the issue '''with kid gloves'''.''

